# EnerjiHat — elle deneme koleksiyonu (VS Code "REST Client" eklentisi)
# Demo parolası: Demo1234!   ·   @ingest = .env içindeki INGEST_TOKEN
@api = http://localhost:8080
@ingest = dev-ingest-token-change-me-0123456789

### 0) Sağlık, metrikler, OpenAPI
GET {{api}}/health

###
GET {{api}}/metrics

###
GET {{api}}/openapi.yaml

### 1) Giriş — her rol (token'lar aşağıdaki isteklerde kullanılır)
# @name admin
POST {{api}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "admin@enerjihat.local", "password": "Demo1234!"}

###
# @name abone
POST {{api}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "abone@enerjihat.local", "password": "Demo1234!"}

###
# @name saha
POST {{api}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "saha@enerjihat.local", "password": "Demo1234!"}

###
# @name fatura
POST {{api}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "fatura@enerjihat.local", "password": "Demo1234!"}

###
# @name operator
POST {{api}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "operator@enerjihat.local", "password": "Demo1234!"}

###
# @name analist
POST {{api}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "analist@enerjihat.local", "password": "Demo1234!"}

### 1b) Yanlış parola → 401 invalid_credentials
POST {{api}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "admin@enerjihat.local", "password": "yanlis"}

### 2) Refresh (aynı refresh_token ikinci kez → 401 refresh_reused)
POST {{api}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{"refresh_token": "{{analist.response.body.refresh_token}}"}

###
GET {{api}}/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{abone.response.body.access_token}}

### 3) Yetki ihlali: abone → yönetim (403), abone → başka abone (403)
GET {{api}}/api/v1/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{abone.response.body.access_token}}

###
GET {{api}}/api/v1/subscribers/2/consumption
Authorization: Bearer {{abone.response.body.access_token}}

###
GET {{api}}/api/v1/live
Authorization: Bearer {{operator.response.body.access_token}}

### 4) F-1 Abone + sayaç kaydı
POST {{api}}/api/v1/subscribers
Authorization: Bearer {{fatura.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: elle-abone-0001

{"full_name": "Elle Deneme", "address": "Liman Cd. 1, Bandırma", "category": "residential", "pole_id": 3,
 "tariff_id": 1, "contract_kw": 7.5, "meter_serial_no": "SM-ELLE-0001", "installed_at": "2026-08-01T00:00:00+03:00"}

###
GET {{api}}/api/v1/subscribers?limit=20&category=residential
Authorization: Bearer {{fatura.response.body.access_token}}

###
GET {{api}}/api/v1/subscribers/1
Authorization: Bearer {{fatura.response.body.access_token}}

###
GET {{api}}/api/v1/tariffs
Authorization: Bearer {{fatura.response.body.access_token}}

### 5) F-2 Okuma alma (head-end): aynı partiyi iki kez gönderin → ikincisinde duplicates
POST {{api}}/api/v1/readings/batch
X-Ingest-Token: {{ingest}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"readings": [
  {"meter_id": 1, "read_at": "2026-09-01T00:00:00+03:00", "active_index_wh": 100000, "reactive_index_varh": 0},
  {"meter_id": 1, "read_at": "2026-09-01T00:15:00+03:00", "active_index_wh": 100120, "reactive_index_varh": 0},
  {"meter_id": 1, "read_at": "2026-09-01T01:15:00+03:00", "active_index_wh": 100600, "reactive_index_varh": 0},
  {"meter_id": 1, "read_at": "2026-09-01T00:07:00+03:00", "active_index_wh": 1, "reactive_index_varh": 0}
]}

### 5b) Geriye dönük düzeltme (aynı zaman, farklı değer → corrections=1)
POST {{api}}/api/v1/readings/batch
X-Ingest-Token: {{ingest}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"readings": [{"meter_id": 1, "read_at": "2026-09-01T00:15:00+03:00", "active_index_wh": 100150, "reactive_index_varh": 0}]}

### 5c) Saha ekibi elle okuma
POST {{api}}/api/v1/readings
Authorization: Bearer {{saha.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"meter_id": 2, "read_at": "2026-09-01T00:00:00+03:00", "active_index_wh": 250000, "reactive_index_varh": 0}

###
POST {{api}}/api/v1/admin/consumption/recompute
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.access_token}}

###
GET {{api}}/api/v1/meters/1/readings?from=2026-09-01&to=2026-09-02
Authorization: Bearer {{operator.response.body.access_token}}

###
GET {{api}}/api/v1/readings/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{operator.response.body.access_token}}

### 6) F-3 Tüketim (günlük ve 15 dk; quality: measured/interpolated/corrected/reset/meter_change)
GET {{api}}/api/v1/subscribers/1/consumption?granularity=day&from=2026-09-25&to=2026-10-26
Authorization: Bearer {{abone.response.body.access_token}}

###
GET {{api}}/api/v1/subscribers/1/consumption?granularity=15m&from=2026-09-01&to=2026-09-02
Authorization: Bearer {{abone.response.body.access_token}}

### 7) T-1 Sayaç değişimi (saha ekibi)
POST {{api}}/api/v1/subscribers/3/meter-change
Authorization: Bearer {{saha.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: elle-sayac-degisim-01

{"at": "2026-10-24T12:00:00+03:00", "final_index_wh": 99999999, "new_serial_no": "SM-ELLE-NEW-3", "initial_index_wh": 0}

### 8) F-4/T-2 Fatura üret (aynı istek ikinci kez → 200 created=false, aynı fatura)
# @name gen
POST {{api}}/api/v1/billing/invoices/generate
Authorization: Bearer {{fatura.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"subscriber_id": 1, "period": "2026-10"}

###
GET {{api}}/api/v1/invoices/{{gen.response.body.invoice.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{abone.response.body.access_token}}

### Önizleme (Ekim: 15 Ekim tarife değişikliği → iki parça)
GET {{api}}/api/v1/subscribers/1/invoice-preview?period=2026-10
Authorization: Bearer {{abone.response.body.access_token}}

### Girdi değiştiyse yeniden kes
POST {{api}}/api/v1/billing/invoices/generate
Authorization: Bearer {{fatura.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"subscriber_id": 1, "period": "2026-10", "reissue": true}

###
POST {{api}}/api/v1/billing/runs
Authorization: Bearer {{fatura.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"period": "2026-09", "limit": 50}

###
GET {{api}}/api/v1/invoices?limit=20&period=2026-09
Authorization: Bearer {{fatura.response.body.access_token}}

### 9) Ödeme (Idempotency-Key zorunlu; aynı anahtar → aynı cevap, tek ödeme)
POST {{api}}/api/v1/invoices/{{gen.response.body.invoice.id}}/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{abone.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: elle-odeme-000001

{"amount_kurus": 1000}

### 10) F-5/T-3 Şebeke
GET {{api}}/api/v1/network/tree?root=1
Authorization: Bearer {{operator.response.body.access_token}}

###
GET {{api}}/api/v1/network/nodes/2/impact
Authorization: Bearer {{operator.response.body.access_token}}

### Döngü denemesi → 409 topology_cycle (direği kendi alt düğümünün altına)
POST {{api}}/api/v1/network/switch
Authorization: Bearer {{operator.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"node_id": 3, "new_parent_id": 10}

### Besleyiciyi yedek trafoya aktar / geri al
POST {{api}}/api/v1/network/switch
Authorization: Bearer {{operator.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"node_id": 2, "new_parent_id": 29}

###
POST {{api}}/api/v1/network/nodes/2/restore-normal
Authorization: Bearer {{operator.response.body.access_token}}

### Planlı kesinti (aynı yolda çakışan ikincisi → 409 planned_overlap)
POST {{api}}/api/v1/outages
Authorization: Bearer {{operator.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: elle-planli-0001

{"kind": "planned", "fault_node_id": 2, "cause": "bakım", "planned_start": "2026-12-01T09:00:00+03:00", "planned_end": "2026-12-01T12:00:00+03:00"}

###
POST {{api}}/api/v1/outages
Authorization: Bearer {{operator.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"kind": "planned", "fault_node_id": 4, "cause": "bakım", "planned_start": "2026-12-01T11:00:00+03:00", "planned_end": "2026-12-01T13:00:00+03:00"}

###
GET {{api}}/api/v1/reports/reliability?from=2026-10-01&to=2026-11-01
Authorization: Bearer {{analist.response.body.access_token}}

### 11) F-6/T-5 Kesinti bildirimleri (çağrı merkezi / head-end)
# @name s1
POST {{api}}/api/v1/outage-signals
X-Ingest-Token: {{ingest}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"source": "last_gasp", "subscriber_id": 101, "external_id": "elle-lg-101"}

###
POST {{api}}/api/v1/outage-signals
X-Ingest-Token: {{ingest}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"source": "call", "subscriber_id": 101, "external_id": "elle-call-101", "note": "elektrik yok"}

###
GET {{api}}/api/v1/outages?open=true&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{operator.response.body.access_token}}

###
GET {{api}}/api/v1/outages/{{s1.response.body.outage_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{operator.response.body.access_token}}

###
GET {{api}}/api/v1/outages/{{s1.response.body.outage_id}}/signals
Authorization: Bearer {{operator.response.body.access_token}}

###
POST {{api}}/api/v1/outages/{{s1.response.body.outage_id}}/transition
Authorization: Bearer {{operator.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"to": "confirmed", "note": "elle onay"}

###
POST {{api}}/api/v1/outages/{{s1.response.body.outage_id}}/dispatch
Authorization: Bearer {{operator.response.body.access_token}}

###
GET {{api}}/api/v1/crews
Authorization: Bearer {{operator.response.body.access_token}}

###
GET {{api}}/api/v1/crew/me
Authorization: Bearer {{saha.response.body.access_token}}

###
POST {{api}}/api/v1/crew/me/transition
Authorization: Bearer {{saha.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"to": "in_progress"}

###
GET {{api}}/api/v1/me/outages
Authorization: Bearer {{abone.response.body.access_token}}

### 12) Idempotency: aynı anahtar + farklı gövde → 422 idempotency_key_mismatch
POST {{api}}/api/v1/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: elle-kullanici-0001

{"email": "yeni.analist@enerjihat.local", "full_name": "Yeni Analist", "password": "Parola123!", "role": "analyst"}

###
GET {{api}}/api/v1/admin/audit?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.access_token}}

### 13) F-7/T-4 Kayıp-kaçak
POST {{api}}/api/v1/analytics/loss/run
Authorization: Bearer {{analist.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

###
GET {{api}}/api/v1/analytics/loss/transformers?from=2026-10-18&to=2026-10-26
Authorization: Bearer {{analist.response.body.access_token}}

###
# @name sus
GET {{api}}/api/v1/analytics/suspects?limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{analist.response.body.access_token}}

###
POST {{api}}/api/v1/analytics/suspects/{{sus.response.body.items[0].id}}/review
Authorization: Bearer {{analist.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status": "confirmed", "note": "saha kontrolü"}

###
GET {{api}}/api/v1/analytics/loss/evaluation
Authorization: Bearer {{analist.response.body.access_token}}
